**/perf.data
**/perf.data.*

# sensitive/local-only files (never commit)
/osprey-dev.pem
/aws_instance_*.txt
/aws_volume_id.txt
/aws_keys.md

# IDE/editor workspace files (local-only)
/osprey-fork_modern.code-workspace

